# Security headers for every route.
# Cloudflare Pages honours this file the same way it already honours
# public/_redirects (static-export copies public/* to the output root).
#
# Safe subset only — no Content-Security-Policy, so nothing the page loads
# (Turnstile, PostHog, CF beacon) can be accidentally blocked. A CSP template
# is provided commented-out below; VERIFY it against the live site before
# enabling — a wrong policy silently breaks scripts.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()

